"Select all (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-medium); padding: 1px 6px; "
"border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); font-size: "
"0.8rem;\">Ctrl+A</kbd>) and copy (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-"
"medium); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var"
"(--card-border); font-size: 0.8rem;\">Ctrl+C</kbd>). You can copy the "
"entire JSON &mdash; we'll extract the token automatically."
msgstr ""
"Selecteer alles (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-medium); padding: 1px "
"6px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); font-size:"
" 0.8rem;\">Ctrl+A</kbd>) en kopieer (<kbd style=\"background: var(--bg-"
"medium); padding: 1px 6px; border-radius: 3px; border: 1px solid var"
"(--card-border); font-size: 0.8rem;\">Ctrl+C</kbd>). Je kunt de volledige"
" JSON kopiëren &mdash; we halen het token er automatisch uit."

